{"id":"497701","name":"小番茄紫菜蛋汤","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"","cover":"images/497701/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"紫菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小番茄","amount":"3个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"3棵"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备食材：紫菜，小番茄，鸡蛋。","img":"images/497701/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香菜切小段。","img":"images/497701/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"康宁小汤锅，加适量的水，下小番茄，切点姜丝煮开。","img":"images/497701/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮沸后，调少许盐，胡椒粉，油。","img":"images/497701/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把紫菜下去煮2分钟。","img":"images/497701/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"鸡蛋打散倒入汤中煮一分钟。","img":"images/497701/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"轻轻搅拌下下。","img":"images/497701/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"最后下香菜，关火，滴几滴香油，完成了。","img":"images/497701/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/497701/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。好喝哦。","img":"images/497701/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"紫菜是免洗的。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}